      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we are announcing our first data center in the state of Wyoming, in partnership with Tallgrass Energy, Black Hills Energy, American Electric Power (AEP), and Related Digital.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/infrastructure-and-cloud/global-network/wyoming-data-center/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-05T18:01:43.615Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We will pay for 100% of the power we use, and when we build data centers, we’ll cover the infrastructure needs directly driven by our growth.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/infrastructure-and-cloud/global-network/wyoming-data-center/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-05T18:01:43.615Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The fuel cells for this project will be made in America by Bloom Energy and will help minimize emissions and water use in the production of energy for our data infrastructure.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/infrastructure-and-cloud/global-network/wyoming-data-center/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-05T18:01:43.615Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This is in addition to our community investment plans, which will focus on initiatives in K-12 education, workforce development, and pathways to accelerate Wyoming’s economy.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/infrastructure-and-cloud/global-network/wyoming-data-center/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
